    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010480/extras/ae7987f56526ce04cc4368a4c9a72a63.poster.avif?t=1726061503\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010480/extras/ae7987f56526ce04cc4368a4c9a72a63.webm?t=1726061503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010480/extras/ae7987f56526ce04cc4368a4c9a72a63.mp4?t=1726061503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Play as a wizard and turn into a shadow to solve the puzzles and clear the level. Shadow Trick is a platformer game taking place in a magic castle with different biomes full of minions, traps, and boss fights. Keep an eye on your shadow and don't let your eyes trick you!<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Clever gameplay<br></li><li> 20+ levels <br></li><li> Boss fights<br></li><li> 16-bit aesthetics<br></li><li> Charming music tracks</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010480/extras/ae7987f56526ce04cc4368a4c9a72a63.poster.avif?t=1726061503\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010480/extras/ae7987f56526ce04cc4368a4c9a72a63.webm?t=1726061503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010480/extras/ae7987f56526ce04cc4368a4c9a72a63.mp4?t=1726061503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Play as a wizard and turn into a shadow to solve the puzzles and clear the level. Shadow Trick is a platformer game taking place in a magic castle with different biomes full of minions, traps, and boss fights. Keep an eye on your shadow and don't let your eyes trick you!<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Clever gameplay<br></li><li> 20+ levels <br></li><li> Boss fights<br></li><li> 16-bit aesthetics<br></li><li> Charming music tracks</li></ul>",
